'''Forest Playground''' (遊園森林ガングール, ''Yūen Shinrin Gangūru'', '''Amusement Forest Ganguul''') is the 18th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 116th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This subchapter's about as hard as the past few Zero Legends sub-chapters. The only slightly challenging stages here are [[Broadleaf Yo-Yo]] and [[Marble Swamp]], while the rest of the stages range from pretty easy ([[Bamboocopter Launch]], [[Waterweed Trumpet]] and [[Beloved Waterfall]]) to literal joke stages ([[Trompo Foothills]]).

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Shachiko]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Dolphina]] with a guaranteed 6-second curse and different ranges: 190 standing range, 250~550 Long Distance. Otherwise behaves much like Dolphina.
*[[Zyclone]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] from [[The Rolling Dead]]. Has all the hallmarks of a Cyclone - high health and damage, incredibly fast attacks, very low speed and range - but can also revive with 100% HP an unlimited number of times. Unlike his [[Li'l Zyclone|nephew]], he doesn't burrow.

